<title>USA: IMM currency futures remain higher late.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures remain higher late.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 6 - Most IMM currency futures remained moderately to sharply higher in late trading. Activity occurred in spurts, with yen earlier popping back up briefly on managed fund buying that some said looked like loss-cutting. Canadian dollar edged upward, some technicians saw more gains nearterm. June marks held above trendline support at $0.5814.</p>
